ratio on impaired loans of 29 basis points was up 5 basis points year-over-year, mainly due to the Barbados government restructuring on sovereign loans.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/23/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q3-2018-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2019-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mario Mendonca","x":"Is it conceivable we'll see another restructuring charge to push this strategy forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2019-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Sohrab Movahedi","x":"So just to be clear, the headcount reduction has had really no bearing on the expense line in your segment?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/28/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q2","e":"cm","d":"2019-05-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Victor Dodig","x":"Across our bank, we also continue to invest in key enterprise infrastructure and capabilities that will support our businesses and defend CIBC, including investing in the strategic use of data, artificial intelligence, automation, and ongoing investments in cybersecurity and risk management.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q2","e":"cm","d":"2019-05-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Capatides","x":"On the deposit side, we are still seeing some pressures on NIM from price increases, but that should subside, we hope, in the coming quarters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q2","e":"cm","d":"2019-05-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor Dodig","x":"Over time, further acquisitions are in the radar screen, but we're going to be patient to find the right cultural fit, the right size so that we can make things, again, accretive to our shareholders in a reasonable period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/22/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q2-2019-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2019-12-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"Across CIBC, we will continue to simplify and streamline our operations, optimizing our efficiency and changing our cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/cibc-cm-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2019 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2019-12-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"If you look at the last couple of years, we've made progress on simplifying our bank and improving efficiency in a number of ways and we use that through a combination of restructuring charges in 2016 and importantly normal course efficiency gains.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/05/cibc-cm-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2020-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"Harry Culham will continue to lead our Capital Markets franchise and will add accountability for oversight of FirstCaribbean, as well as our direct to consumer businesses, which include Simplii Financial, Direct Investing and Advice, and our Alternate Solutions Group.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"So I am going to pass it on to CK, go ahead.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2020-02-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"So Harry, let me just pass it on to you in terms of highlighting anything else you'd like to highlight in that regard.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"This also includes reviewing our organizational structure, maximizing our capabilities and streamlining decision making, all to further enable execution of our growth strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"To that end, the restructuring charge we announced this morning supports an enterprisewide program to accelerate delivery of our priorities, including improving our efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2020-02-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Laura Dottori-Attanasio","x":"And while provisions for losses were low this quarter, we are maintaining our guidance of below 30 basis points on provisions for impaired loans for fiscal 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2020-earn.aspx"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2020-08-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Hratch Panossian","x":"I'll start and I'll pass it on to Shawn to talk a little bit about the credit migration in more detail after.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2020-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"We have a number of key strategic initiatives under way to further streamline operations, improve our efficiency, and enable us to reinvest strategically to further strengthen our market position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2020-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"As you recall, we announced a workforce restructuring earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2020-12-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"And I just want to pass it on to Hratch for some of the technicalities around that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/03/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2020-12-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Hratch Panossian","x":"The recent restructuring we did this year, that's largely completed, it will give us that full-year benefit of CAD250 million we've talked about.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/03/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2020 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2020-12-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Aiken","x":"I noted that you've still got about CAD200 million left from the restructuring charge taken this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/03/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q4-2020-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2021 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2021-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"I'm going to pass it on to Harry, because he oversees that business with our team down there, and he can shed some additional light, and then I'll take your second question.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/cibc-cm-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2021 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"Over the past five years, we have focused on streamlining our operations and eliminating inefficiencies to reduce our cost base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/cibc-cm-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2021 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"Through these efforts, we've achieved cumulative cost savings of more than CAD800 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/cibc-cm-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2021 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2021-08-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Hratch Panossian","x":"Going forward, we intend to continue investing in our business to build on the recent performance and we maintain our guidance for fiscal 2021, namely, low-single-digit expense growth excluding performance-based compensation and mid-single-digit growth overall.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q3-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2021 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2021-12-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"With that, I'd like to open the call up for questions and pass it on to the operator.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/03/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q4-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2021 Q4","e":"cm","d":"2021-12-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor G. Dodig","x":"I can pass it on to my colleague, Mike Capatides in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/12/03/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q4-2021-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2022 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2022-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jon Hountalas","x":"They can push through price increases supply chain challenges aren't really impacting when inventory comes in late, clients are able to sell it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/25/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2022-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2022 Q1","e":"cm","d":"2022-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor Dodig","x":"Over the past few years, we have invested significant resources to enhance our banking capabilities, to grow market share, and to streamline our cost base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/25/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q1-2022-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2022 Q2","e":"cm","d":"2022-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Laura Dottori-Attanasio","x":"I think you've seen -- we've taken market leadership position in raising prices over the last few months when it comes to mortgage pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q2-2022-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2022 Q2","e":"cm","d":"2022-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jon Hountalas","x":"Demand for product is there. price increases continue to get passed on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/26/canadian-imperial-bank-of-commerce-cm-q2-2022-earn/"},{"c":"CM 2026 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2026-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Harry Culham","x":"Second, we launched CIBC AdvisorAssist, an AI-enabled platform that helps advisers spend more time with clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2026 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2026-08-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Christian Exshaw","x":"We continue building product suites that fit our clients, for instance, in the AI space, whether it's around project finance, infrastructure and energy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2026 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2026-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Guse","x":"We have built additional reserves for tariff-related risks through expert credit judgment overlay since the beginning of fiscal '25 and continue to build our allowance this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CM 2026 Q3","e":"cm","d":"2026-08-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Guse","x":"Our most sensitive business lending exposures to the tariff impacts represent less than 1% of the bank's total loan portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/27/cibc-cm-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,9611,0,0,0,6799,2033],[34,1,9874,0,0,0,6467,2850],[36,1,9542,0,0,0,7232,1860],[37,1,10103,0,0,0,7363,2202],[39,1,9437,0,0,0,6936,1989],[40,1,10247,0,0,0,7833,1917],[41,1,13423,0,0,0,10732,2189],[42,1,11372,0,0,0,9024,1899],[43,1,13306,0,0,0,11039,1703],[44,1,10707,0,0,0,8548,1645],[45,1,9295,0,0,0,7632,1222],[46,1,10111,0,0,0,7656,1985],[47,1,12880,0,0,0,9742,2630],[48,1,10597,0,0,0,7716,2419],[49,1,9064,0,0,0,6890,1720],[50,1,10200,0,0,0,8118,1691],[65,1,6492,0,0,0,5152,1172],[66,1,7697,0,0,0,6548,942]],"cinema":[[33,1,9611,0,0,0,6799,2033],[34,1,9874,0,0,0,6467,2850],[36,1,9542,0,0,0,7232,1860],[37,1,10103,0,0,0,7363,2202],[39,1,9437,0,0,0,6936,1989],[40,1,10247,0,0,0,7833,1917],[41,1,13423,0,0,0,10732,2189],[42,1,11372,0,0,0,9024,1899],[43,1,13306,0,0,0,11039,1703],[44,1,10707,0,0,0,8548,1645],[45,1,9295,0,0,0,7632,1222],[46,1,10111,0,0,0,7656,1985],[47,1,12880,0,0,0,9742,2630],[48,1,10597,0,0,0,7716,2419],[49,1,9064,0,0,0,6890,1720],[50,1,10200,0,0,0,8118,1691],[65,1,6492,0,0,0,5152,1172],[66,1,7697,0,0,0,6548,942]],"imax":[[33,1,9611,0,0,0,6799,2033],[34,1,9874,0,0,0,6467,2850],[36,1,9542,0,0,0,7232,1860],[37,1,10103,0,0,0,7363,2202],[39,1,9437,0,0,0,6936,1989],[40,1,10247,0,0,0,7833,1917],[41,1,13423,0,0,0,10732,2189],[42,1,11372,0,0,0,9024,1899],[43,1,13306,0,0,0,11039,1703],[44,1,10707,0,0,0,8548,1645],[45,1,9295,0,0,0,7632,1222],[46,1,10111,0,0,0,7656,1985],[47,1,12880,0,0,0,9742,2630],[48,1,10597,0,0,0,7716,2419],[49,1,9064,0,0,0,6890,1720],[50,1,10200,0,0,0,8118,1691],[65,1,6492,0,0,0,5152,1172],[66,1,7697,0,0,0,6548,942]],